WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.212 --> 00:00:03.740
You're at the end of SQL operators and
sorting and filtering data.

2
00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.037
Well done.

3
00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:07.707
Having a lot of data stored
in the database is great.

4
00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.577
Making sense of all that
data is even better.

5
00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:15.474
That's why using SQL to manipulate the
data becomes a much sought after skill.

6
00:00:15.474 --> 00:00:20.285
You might remember the SQL operators can
accomplish tasks such as arithmetic and

7
00:00:20.285 --> 00:00:21.210
comparisons.

8
00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:24.321
Data can be filtered using
the WHERE clause and

9
00:00:24.321 --> 00:00:26.649
