10
00:00:26.649 --> 00:00:30.703
Just to finish up,
let's recap the key points of this module.

11
00:00:30.703 --> 00:00:35.394
Here at the end of this module, you
should now be able to demonstrate the SQL

12
00:00:35.394 --> 00:00:40.313
