20
00:01:06.709 --> 00:01:10.657
Finally, you also explored
the SELECT DISTINCT clause.

21
00:01:10.657 --> 00:01:15.751
Following this, you should now be able to
explain the purpose of SELECT DISTINCT,

22
00:01:15.751 --> 00:01:20.555
