26
00:01:31.131 --> 00:01:34.626
That's one of the first steps to
giving real value to that data.

27
00:01:34.626 --> 00:01:38.061
With your SQL skills, the database
is now no longer just a store,

28
00:01:38.061 --> 00:01:41.751
